## 3. GraphMapProblem – kodo trasavimas (debug)

### Breakpointai

| # | Failas | Eilutė | Kas vyksta |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | GraphMapProblem.py | 6 | [switch_country_map("Romania")](file:///c:/Users/jarek/Desktop/dirbt%20intelekt%202/Artificial-Intelligence-Course-main/search.py#1201-1821) – užkraunamas žemėlapis |
| 2 | GraphMapProblem.py | 8 | [GraphProblem("Arad", "Bucharest", romania_map)](file:///c:/Users/jarek/Desktop/dirbt%20intelekt%202/Artificial-Intelligence-Course-main/search.py#1880-1917) – sukuriamas uždavinys |
| 3 | GraphMapProblem.py | 15 | [breadth_first_graph_search(romania_problem)](file:///c:/Users/jarek/Desktop/dirbt%20intelekt%202/Artificial-Intelligence-Course-main/search.py#273-298) – paleidžiamas BFS |
| 4 | search.py | 279 | `node = Node(problem.initial)` – pradinis mazgas |
| 5 | search.py | 285 | `node = frontier.popleft()` – imamas iš eilės |
| 6 | search.py | 100 | `node.expand(problem)` – generuojami kaimynai |

### Žingsnis po žingsnio trasavimas

```
═══ 1 ŽINGSNIS: Žemėlapio užkrovimas ═══
GraphMapProblem.py:6 → switch_country_map("Romania")
  ↓ search.py:1201
  → maps.romania_map_start = "Arad"
  → maps.romania_map_goal  = "Bucharest"
  → maps.romania_map = UndirectedGraph(dict(
      Arad=dict(Zerind=75, Sibiu=140, Timisoara=118), ...))
  → Sukuriamas Graph objektas su visais miestais ir atstumais

═══ 2 ŽINGSNIS: Sukuriamas uždavinys ═══
GraphMapProblem.py:8 → GraphProblem("Arad", "Bucharest", romania_map)
  ↓ Problem.__init__()
  → self.initial = "Arad"
  → self.goal    = "Bucharest"
  → self.graph   = romania_map    ← Graph objektas

═══ 3 ŽINGSNIS: Paleidžiamas BFS ═══
search.py:279 → node = Node(state="Arad", parent=None, depth=0, cost=0)
  → frontier = deque([node])
  → explored = set()

═══ 4 ŽINGSNIS: Pirmoji iteracija ═══
search.py:285 → node = frontier.popleft()
  → node.state = "Arad"
  → explored.add("Arad")

search.py:288 → node.expand(problem)
  ↓ Node.expand() kviečia problem.actions("Arad")
    ↓ GraphProblem.actions("Arad")
      → return list(self.graph.get("Arad").keys())
      → return ["Zerind", "Sibiu", "Timisoara"]    ← 3 kaimynai

  ↓ child_node() kiekvienam kaimynui:
    Vaikas 1: action="Zerind"
      → GraphProblem.result("Arad", "Zerind") → return "Zerind"
      → path_cost = 0 + graph.get("Arad","Zerind") = 0 + 75 = 75
      → Node(state="Zerind", parent=Arad, depth=1, cost=75)

    Vaikas 2: action="Sibiu"
      → path_cost = 0 + 140 = 140
      → Node(state="Sibiu", parent=Arad, depth=1, cost=140)

    Vaikas 3: action="Timisoara"
      → path_cost = 0 + 118 = 118
      → Node(state="Timisoara", parent=Arad, depth=1, cost=118)

  → goal_test("Zerind")=False, goal_test("Sibiu")=False, ...
  → frontier = deque([Zerind, Sibiu, Timisoara])

═══ 5 ŽINGSNIS: Antroji iteracija ═══
→ node = frontier.popleft() → state="Zerind"
→ actions("Zerind") → ["Arad", "Oradea"]
→ "Arad" jau explored → praleidžia
→ Vaikas: Node("Oradea", parent=Zerind, depth=2, cost=75+71=146)
→ frontier = deque([Sibiu, Timisoara, Oradea])

═══ 6 ŽINGSNIS: Trečioji iteracija ═══
→ node = frontier.popleft() → state="Sibiu"
→ actions("Sibiu") → ["Arad", "Fagaras", "Oradea", "Rimnicu"]
→ "Arad" jau explored → praleidžia
→ "Oradea" jau frontier → praleidžia
→ Vaikai: Fagaras(cost=239), Rimnicu(cost=220)
→ frontier = deque([Timisoara, Oradea, Fagaras, Rimnicu])

  ... (tęsiasi) ...

═══ PASKUTINIS ŽINGSNIS ═══
→ expand Fagaras → vaikas "Bucharest"
→ goal_test("Bucharest") == True → return child
→ .solution() → ["Sibiu", "Fagaras", "Bucharest"]
→ insert(0, "Arad") → ["Arad", "Sibiu", "Fagaras", "Bucharest"]
```

